= Civic Labor League

The Civic Labor League is a Municipal Party fielding candidates in Regina[? if cll_expanded = 1 : and Saskatoon?]. It is formed by a coalition of Social Democrats and Communists, unified by a support for urban Labour. 

[? if cll_in_government = 1 : Currently, the CLL is in government and we can use our ties with them to advance our policy goals. ?]

[? if cll_in_government = 0 : The CCL is out of government right now, unfortunately. We may send aid their way to improve their electoral success. ?]

Civic Labor League Strength: [+ ccl_strength : strength +]

- @city_bulwark
- @ccl_aid: Send aid to the CCL
- @root: Return to main

@city_bulwark
title: Urban Bulwark
subtitle: Brockelbank has influence over Urban politics.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and ccf_ss_prussia = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not ccf_ss_prussia : The [+ ccf_ss_name +] is not in control of City Police. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; city_affairs_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: city_affairs


@ccl_aid
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: ccl_strength += 10; resources -= 1

